{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And Avraham — he shall surely become.</b> One interpretation: 'The memory of the righteous is for blessing' — since He mentioned him, He blessed him. Its plain sense: Would I hide it from him? He is beloved before Me, to become a great nation, and through him all the nations of the earth shall be blessed."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:59:15.805193589Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}